msgctxt "621\t730"
msgid "Kiryu! We just caught wind of a big story!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "726\t786"
msgid "Showed up in the evening news."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "925\t995"
msgid "Our politico team's been\\nworking hard to crack this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "997\t1168"
msgid ""
"Tamiya from the Ministry of Defense finally agreed\\nto terms with the "
"Okinawa Prefectural Assembly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1178\t1349"
msgid ""
"In other words, the military expansion\\nhe's been pushing for is a done "
"deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1374\t1466"
msgid "But the base and the resort\\nare two halves of the same whole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1482\t1677"
msgid "If one starts picking up steam,\\nthe other's bound to come with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1678\t1844"
msgid ""
"Guess that explains why the resort's\\nbeen back in the public eye all of a "
"sudden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1842\t1883"
msgid "Oh, and Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884\t2021"
msgid ""
"There's something you might wanna know\\nabout the players in this resort "
"deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2084\t2166"
msgid "This tip found its way to our news desk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2167\t2271"
msgid "It's a photo, sent from an anonymous source."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2401\t2461"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2476\t2596"
msgid "Suzuki's moving ahead with\\nhis resort one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2597\t2771"
msgid ""
"And the ones secretly tapped for construction?\\nNone other than the Majima "
"Family."
msgstr ""
